    "risk_rationale": "In PaySim, `is_merchant_dest` is strictly 1 only on PAYMENT transactions, and in PaySim 100% of frauds occur exclusively on TRANSFER and CASH_OUT rails. Consequently, `is_merchant_dest` is collinear with `type_PAYMENT` and provides zero marginal predictive power (+0.0000 delta PR-AUC). In real-world payment networks, merchant accounts experience significant fraud (e.g., merchant bust-out, fake storefronts, card-not-present fraud). Treating merchant destination as an immunity signal is an artifactual PaySim shortcut and should be avoided in real-world deployment."
